# Production content: exercise titles, and specs whose feedback messages teachers wrote.
# This repo is public, so the export and everything derived from it stays local.
#
# Deliberately broader than the names the docs happen to use. The confirmation step in the runbook
# re-explodes the corpus into a second tree, and every one of these directories is full of real
# exercises — so a pattern that only matched the examples would leave the next person's `after/`
# or `check-2/` untracked-but-committable. summary.txt is the only shareable output, and it lives
# inside one of these.
*.jsonl
out*/
from-*/
migrated*/
after*/
before*/
check*/
verify*/
writeback*.log
easy.log
